---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | AICheck365"
  description="AICheck365 privacy policy. All image and video analysis runs locally in your browser. We explain what data we collect and how we use cookies and advertising."
  canonical="https://www.aicheck365.com/privacy/"
  lang="en"
>
  <main class="page content-page">
    <article class="card content-article">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="article-meta">Last updated: May 2025</p>

      <p class="lead-text">AICheck365 is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your choices.</p>

      <h2>1. Media File Data</h2>
      <p>AICheck365 analyzes images and videos <strong>entirely within your browser</strong> using WebAssembly technology. Your media files are <strong>never uploaded to any server</strong>. No image or video data leaves your device.</p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect limited, non-personal information to operate and improve the service:</p>
      <ul class="content-list">
        <li><strong>Usage analytics</strong>: Page views, session duration, and feature interactions via Google Analytics 4. This data is anonymized and aggregated.</li>
        <li><strong>Browser storage</strong>: We use <code>localStorage</code> to store your language preference and recent detection history (stored only on your device).</li>
        <li><strong>Log data</strong>: Standard web server logs including IP address, browser type, and referring URL. Logs are retained for up to 30 days.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Cookies and Advertising</h2>
      <p>AICheck365 uses the following third-party services that may set cookies:</p>
      <ul class="content-list">
        <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong>: We display advertisements served by Google AdSense. Google may use cookies to show you personalized ads based on your interests. You can opt out at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong>: We use GA4 to understand how visitors use the site. Google Analytics uses cookies. You can opt out using the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>By using AICheck365, you consent to the use of these cookies. You can control cookies through your browser settings.</p>

      <h2>4. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul class="content-list">
        <li>To operate and maintain the website</li>
        <li>To understand usage patterns and improve the service</li>
        <li>To display relevant advertisements</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>AICheck365 is hosted on Cloudflare Pages. Cloudflare may process traffic data subject to their <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      <p>Google AdSense and Analytics are subject to Google's <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

      <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Analytics data is retained for 14 months (Google Analytics default). Server logs are retained for 30 days. No image or video data is retained since it never leaves your browser.</p>

      <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Depending on your location, you may have rights including:</p>
      <ul class="content-list">
        <li>Access to your personal data</li>
        <li>Correction or deletion of your data</li>
        <li>Opting out of personalized advertising</li>
        <li>Data portability</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at the address below.</p>

      <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>AICheck365 is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post the updated policy on this page with a revised date.</p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Base>
